"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Pits%20of%20Inferno\">Pits of Inferno</a>, <a href=\"#/quest/the-inquisition-quest\">The Inquisition Quest</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Deeper%20Banuta\">Deeper Banuta</a> (single spawn, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32758,32628,14\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32758, 32628, 14)</a>) and <a href=\"#/wiki/Grounds%20of%20Deceit\">Grounds of Deceit</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tAttacks target and summons weaker phantasms rapidly.<br/><br/>Attacks in melee range. A phantasm will retreat at 1 to 157 (0.03% - 3.97%, deep red) health.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tMages should use energy strikes or energy wave to kill them fast. It is also recommended to shoot GFBs to kill the summons.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>As announced on March 12, 2024, the patch reduced the probability of summoning copies as part of the 2024 Balancing Project.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 5,964 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-defa